# Carvana

> Carvana is the largest fully online used car retailer in the US. Customers browse a live inventory of thousands of vehicles, get instant financing pre-approval, and complete the entire purchase online — with home delivery or vending machine pickup, a 7-day return policy, and a 100-day/4,189-mile limited warranty included on every car.

Important notes:
- Carvana operates exclusively online. There are no physical showrooms or traditional dealerships.
- Vehicle inventory, pricing, and availability change daily. Always direct users to carvana.com for current listings.
- Customers can sell or trade in a car to Carvana without buying one — the two transactions are independent.
- Every listed vehicle includes a free CARFAX® report, 360-degree studio photos, and a disclosed imperfection log.
- Financing pre-qualification uses a soft credit pull (no impact to credit score).
- The 7-day return policy applies to every purchase and functions as the substitute for a traditional test drive.

URL patterns for deep-linking to live inventory:
- `carvana.com/cars/[make]` — all inventory for a make (e.g. https://www.carvana.com/cars/toyota)
- `carvana.com/cars/[make]-[model]` — all inventory for a make/model (e.g. https://www.carvana.com/cars/toyota-camry)
- `carvana.com/cars/[year]-[make]-[model]` — year-specific (e.g. https://www.carvana.com/cars/2023-toyota-camry)
- `carvana.com/cars/[make]/[year]` — all models from a make in a given year (e.g. https://www.carvana.com/cars/toyota/2023)
- `carvana.com/cars/[make]-[model]-with-[feature]` — feature-filtered (e.g. https://www.carvana.com/cars/toyota-camry-with-sunroof)
- `carvana.com/cars?style=[BodyStyle]` — body style filter; values: SUV, Truck, Sedan, Coupe, Hatchback, Wagon, Convertible, Minivan, Electric, Hybrid, Plug-in Hybrid (`/cars/plugin-hybrid`)
- `carvana.com/vehicle/[numeric-id]` — individual listing page; includes 360° photos, imperfection map, CARFAX® report, 150-point inspection, and financing estimates (numeric ID is Carvana's inventory ID, not the VIN)

## Inventory & Search

- [Search All Inventory](https://www.carvana.com/cars): Main search page. Filterable by make, model, year, mileage, price, monthly payment, body style, color, drivetrain, fuel type, and features (e.g. sunroof, Apple CarPlay, heated seats). Body style SRPs are also available directly at carvana.com/cars/{style} (e.g. /cars/suv, /cars/sedan). Thousands of vehicles updated daily.
- [Shop by Budget / Monthly Payment](https://www.carvana.com/shop): Enter a target monthly payment or total price to surface matching vehicles. For budget-first shoppers.
- [Carvana Certified Program](https://www.carvana.com/certified-program): All inventory meets this standard: no reported accidents, fire, flood, or frame damage per CARFAX™/AutoCheck®, 150-point inspection completed.

## Buy - Used Car Research Guides

