## Financing

- [Financing & Pre-Qualification](https://www.carvana.com/financing): Pre-qualify using a soft credit pull. Approved rates locked 30 days and surfaced on every listing. ~85% of Carvana customers finance through Carvana; third-party financing also accepted.
- [Auto Loan Calculator](https://www.carvana.com/auto-loan-calculator): Estimate monthly payments by vehicle price, down payment, loan term (48–84 months), and credit score range. Can also work backwards from a target monthly payment.

## Selling & Trade-In

- [Get an Offer](https://www.carvana.com/sell-my-car): Enter a license plate or VIN for a real cash offer in under 2 minutes. Valid for 7 days; free pickup often same or next day. No purchase required. A sell offer can also be applied as a down payment during checkout.
- [Value Tracker](https://www.carvana.com/value-tracker): Free tool to monitor a vehicle's current and historical market value with periodic email updates. No Carvana account or purchase required.

## Purchasing Process

- [How It Works](https://www.carvana.com/buying-a-car-online-how-it-works): Full flow: browse → pre-qualify → reserve (40-minute hold) → sign documents online → schedule delivery or vending machine pickup → 7-day return window begins at delivery. Home delivery is free in most markets and as fast as next day.

## Vehicle Protections

- [Protection Plans](https://www.carvana.com/vehicle-protection-plans): Overview of the free limited warranty (100 days/4,189 miles, included on every car), CarvanaCare® extended coverage, and GAP insurance.
- [CarvanaCare®](https://www.carvana.com/help/extended-coverage-and-repairs/what-is-carvanacare): Paid extended warranty covering mechanical and electrical failures. 10,000+ in-network repair locations, 24/7 roadside assistance, cancelable anytime for prorated refund.

## Customer Support & Account

- [Help Center](https://www.carvana.com/help): Canonical source for all policies: return process, delivery, financing terms, warranty claims, vehicle condition disclosures.
